    {"type": "cause", "text": "That growth came from strong demand for EPYC processors and Instinct GPU accelerators [P13]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Client and Gaming added 19.0pp in FY2025, with Client revenue up 51% on a 31% rise in processor unit shipments and a 15% rise in average selling price [D701][P10]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Operating income grew 94.4% against revenue growth of 34.3%, an incremental operating margin of 20.3% [D484][D483][D511]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Diluted EPS rose 165.0% against net income growth of 164.2%, as the diluted share count was flat at -0.1% [D487][D485][D506]."}
