    {"type": "cause", "text": "Gross margin gains were limited by roughly $440 million of net inventory and related charges tied to the MI308 export control [P14]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "SG&A took 1.2pp off operating margin as it grew 48.9% against revenue growth of 34.3% [D515][D503][D483]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "Net margin of 12.5% exceeded operating margin of 10.7%, helped by $577 million of other income from unrealized investment gains and a $103 million tax benefit [F80][F60][P5][P4]."}
